flf2a$ 9 9 14 -1 4 0 0 0
Cosmeron Bold ASCII -- fallback to basic terminal characters.
Bold stroke variant of the Cosmeron wordmark, with = and # on major strokes.
9 rows, 12 columns per glyph; 0 = power-bar ring, O = central @.
License: EUPL-1.2-or-later.
